## Stuck-session workaround
If a finished session (completion file written, pane idle) shows `state: working` in `timeout 20 claude agents --json` for more than ~5 minutes, send it a message: `herdr pane send-text <pane> "Operator: your … file is final. Do not run tools or change any file. Reply with exactly: … complete."`, then `herdr pane send-keys <pane> Enter`. Never use `claude ps`: it starts a Claude session.

